# Claude Code cycle tooling + audit artifacts (not shipped source)
.claude/
architect-output/

# Filled-in environment files. `examples/slack-bot/.env` was committed with real
# Slack and OpenRouter credentials because nothing here matched it — the example
# directory was imported wholesale from another checkout. The `.env.example`
# alongside it is the file that documents the variables, so it stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# SDK runtime state, written by the agent as it runs: agent registry, message
# transcripts, memory sessions. Same wholesale-import as the `.env` above left
# `examples/slack-bot/.theokit/` tracked, and its registry.json carried the
# absolute path of a developer's home directory into a public repository.
# Runtime state is per-machine — it never belongs in version control.
.theokit/
